    "output": "方法一：枚举\n思路与算法\n我们可以把 grid 分成三个不重叠的部分，然后把每个部分当做「3195. 包含所有 1 的最小矩形面积 I」去解决。\n如上图所示，共有 6 种可能，对于情况 (1),(2),(4),(5)，我们可以枚举三个部分的交界处，而对于情况 (3) 和 (6)，我们可以枚举切割的行和列。时间复杂度为 O(nm)，O(n\n2\n) 或 O(m\n2\n)。\n由于 (1),(2),(3) 逆时针旋转 90 度后与 (4),(5),(6) 一致，因此我们只需考虑原数组和旋转 90 度后的两个数组，分别枚举前三个情况。\n代码\nC++\nJava\nC#\nPython3\nGo\nC\nJavaScript\nTypeScript\nRust\nclass Solution {\n    int minimumSum(vector<vector<int>> &grid, int u, int d, int l, int r) {\n        int min_i = grid.size(), max_i = 0;\n        int min_j = grid[0].size(), max_j = 0;\n        for (int i = u; i <= d; i++) {\n            for (int j = l; j <= r; j++) {\n                if (grid[i][j] == 1) {\n                    min_i = min(min_i, i);\n                    min_j = min(min_j, j);\n                    max_i = max(max_i, i);\n                    max_j = max(max_j, j);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return min_i <= max_i ? (max_i - min_i + 1) * (max_j - min_j + 1) : INT_MAX / 3;\n    }\n    vector<vector<int>> rotate(vector<vector<int>> &vec) {\n        int n = vec.size(), m = vec[0].size();\n        vector<vector<int>> ret(m, vector<int>(n));\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < m; j++) {\n                ret[m - j - 1][i] = vec[i][j];\n            }\n        }\n        return ret;\n    }\n    int solve(vector<vector<int>> &grid) {\n        int n = grid.size(), m = grid[0].size();\n        int res = n * m;\n        for (int i = 0; i + 1 < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j + 1 < m; j++) {\n                res = min(res, minimumSum(grid, 0, i, 0, m - 1)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, i + 1, n - 1, 0, j)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, i + 1, n - 1, j + 1, m - 1));\n                res = min(res, minimumSum(grid, 0, i, 0, j)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, 0, i, j + 1, m - 1)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, i + 1, n - 1, 0, m - 1));\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i + 2 < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = i + 1; j + 1 < n; j++) {\n                res = min(res, minimumSum(grid, 0, i, 0, m - 1)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, i + 1, j, 0, m - 1)\n                             + minimumSum(grid, j + 1, n - 1, 0, m - 1));\n            }\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\npublic:\n    int minimumSum(vector<vector<int>>& grid) {\n        auto rgrid = rotate(grid);\n        return min(solve(grid), solve(rgrid));\n    }\n};\n复杂度分析\n时间复杂度：O(n\n2\nm\n2\n)，其中 n 是 grid 的长度，m 是 grid[0] 的长度。\n空间复杂度：O(nm)。"
